<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brinker cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brinker cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities said it cut its near-term rating on Brinker International Inc to market peform from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell four to 11-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
